    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## pb-generic (N8N-4.1)\n**Trigger:** called by recv-wazuh-alert through Execute Workflow, not waited for (the single call site the router replaces in N8N-1.3).\n**Inputs:** `{alert: <raw Wazuh alert>, config: <lib-config>, recv_execution_id}`.\n**Actions taken:** lib-normalize-wazuh-alert -> lib-thehive-upsert-alert (one TheHive alert per Wazuh alert, dedup by sourceRef) -> ENRICHMENT STUB (no-op until lib-enrich-observable, N8N-2.3/2.4) -> lib-thehive-writeback (comment with this execution id). Malformed input and TheHive failures are parked by lib-error.\n**Systems changed:** TheHive only (alert and comment).\n**Approval:** not needed (no system changes).\n**Owner:** n8n.\nResult of the execution: `outcome` = created / duplicate / parked. Error workflow: recv-n8n-error.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
